[h2]Build 0.9.6[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]The power suit has a new, original look: a rounded diving-style helmet with a wraparound amber visor, a side-mounted lamp and a sensor fin, layered shoulder armour, a riveted breastplate with hazard-stripe trim, overlapping hip plates, and two glowing power cells in a cage on the back with the release wheel between them.
[*]The paint job still covers only the armour plates; the frame, visor, lamp, hazard stripes and power cells keep their own colours.
[/list]
